Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "ID",
    "trade": "handloom cotton scarves",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "USD"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer–seller chat",
      "text": "Mira, buyer, 09:12: Hello, can you make four handloom cotton scarves in indigo?\n\nSari, seller, 09:18: Yes. Each is woven in cotton, with a short fringe. I can pack all four together for shipment from Indonesia.\n\nMira, 09:21: Four sounds good. What is the total in US dollars, including shipping?\n\nSari, 09:25: The total is USD 92.00: USD 80.00 for the scarves and USD 12.00 for shipping.\n\nMira, 09:27: Agreed. Please send the invoice and ship with Pos Indonesia.\n\nSari, 09:30: I will prepare the invoice today and book the parcel for dispatch on 18 March 2025. I will send the receipt when it is booked."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller’s invoice",
      "text": "INVOICE\nSeller: Sari\nBuyer: Mira\nInvoice date: 15 March 2025\nCurrency: USD\n\nFour indigo handloom cotton scarves, USD 20.00 each: USD 80.00\nShipping from Indonesia: USD 12.00\nTotal due: USD 92.00\n\nThe scarves are cotton with short fringes and will be packed together in one parcel. The agreed carrier is Pos Indonesia. Planned dispatch date: 18 March 2025.\n\nPayment is requested through PayPal before dispatch. The seller will provide the shipping receipt after the parcel is booked. The shipping charge covers the agreed shipment only; any import charges at the destination are the buyer’s responsibility."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking receipt",
      "text": "COURIER BOOKING RECEIPT\nCarrier: Pos Indonesia\nSender: Sari, Indonesia\nRecipient: Mira\nBooking date: 18 March 2025\n\nContents declared: four handloom cotton scarves\nDeclared goods value: USD 80.00\nShipping charge paid: USD 12.00\nPackage count: 1\n\nThe parcel was accepted at the counter on the booking date. Tracking information is printed on a separate detachable label, which is not included with this copy. Keep the label with the parcel paperwork for any delivery inquiry. This receipt records the carrier booking and declared contents; it does not record delivery to the recipient."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: USD 92.00",
      "value": "USD 92.00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: four indigo handloom cotton scarves",
      "value": "four indigo handloom cotton scarves"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 18 March 2025",
      "value": "18 March 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Sari",
      "value": "Sari"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking number: parcel tracking number",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: Pos Indonesia",
      "value": "Pos Indonesia"
    }
  ]
}
